{"id":"gefu_hl","lemma":"Gefühl","pos":"noun","rank":500,"glosses":["feeling (either physical sensation or emotion)","sense of something, instinct"],"ipa":"/ɡəˈfyːl/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d0/De-Gef%C3%BChl.ogg/De-Gef%C3%BChl.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"Gefühls","plural":"Gefühle"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich kenne das Gefühl.","en":"I know the feeling.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/394333","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know","l":"kennen"},{"g":"the / that"},null]},{"text":"Hast du noch Gefühle für sie?","en":"Do you still have feelings for her?","words":[{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"still / yet"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"she / they / you"}]},{"text":"Habe ich seine Gefühle verletzt?","en":"Did I hurt his feelings?","words":[{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},null,{"g":"hurt, injured"}]},{"text":"Ich hatte ein gutes Gefühl.","en":"I had a good feeling.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"good","l":"gut"},null]},{"text":"Das Gefühl werde ich nie vergessen.","en":"I'll never forget that feeling.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"never, never at all"},{"g":"to forget"}]}]}